36:53.644 --> 36:57.669
trail. So the only reason we did do that is it would be on more

36:57.717 --> 37:01.036
of a collector road so people don't have to trailer up through a

37:01.536 --> 37:05.001
neighborhood. And this, you can kind of see that dotted line.

37:05.274 --> 37:08.293
There's these natural draws, like natural drainage channels.

37:08.646 --> 37:12.436
So we are planning, and this doesn't show it

37:12.936 --> 37:15.615
